@startuml
' bt-view-kind: state
' bt-view-id: ai-stack:director-pulse-lifecycle
title AI Stack — Director Pulse Lifecycle
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam wrapWidth 220
skinparam maxMessageSize 180

' bt-element-id: idle
' bt-element-id: shadow
' bt-element-id: live
' bt-element-id: paused

state "Idle\nResponsibility: No director pulse is active\nContract: No background state mutation\n[[../../../../ai_stack/story_runtime/director/director_pulse_shadow.py source]]" as idle
state "Shadow Evaluation\nResponsibility: Evaluate pulse without visible delivery\nContract: Evidence only\n[[../../../../ai_stack/story_runtime/block_stream_dual_mode.py source]]" as shadow
state "Live Proposal\nResponsibility: Produce ordered visible blocks\nContract: Proposal-only output\n[[../../../../ai_stack/story_runtime/block_stream_dual_mode.py source]]" as live
state "Gathering Paused\nResponsibility: Suspend mandatory beat consumption while player remains free\nContract: No forced actor return\n[[../../../../ai_stack/story_runtime/session_loop/replanning.py source]]" as paused

idle --> live : "live trigger\ncontract: proposal generation enabled\n[[../../../../ai_stack/story_runtime/block_stream_dual_mode.py source]]"
idle --> shadow : "shadow trigger\ncontract: dual-mode evidence only\n[[../../../../ai_stack/story_runtime/director/director_pulse_shadow.py source]]"
[*] --> idle : "session ready\ncontract: pulse disabled until trigger"
live --> idle : "proposal delivered\ncontract: world-engine decides commit\n[[../../../../ai_stack/story_runtime/block_stream_dual_mode.py source]]"
live --> paused : "required actors absent\ncontract: pause mandatory beat consumption\n[[../../../../ai_stack/story_runtime/session_loop/replanning.py source]]"
paused --> live : "co-presence restored\ncontract: resume without forced action\n[[../../../../ai_stack/story_runtime/session_loop/replanning.py source]]"
shadow --> idle : "evidence emitted\ncontract: no visible blocks committed\n[[../../../../ai_stack/story_runtime/director/director_pulse_shadow.py source]]"

legend bottom
Viewpoint: state
Concern: Shadow/live dual mode and gathering pause semantics
Elements expose responsibility, contract and source anchor.
Edges name the interaction or dependency contract.
endlegend
@enduml
